<title>USA: Capitol Bancorp files to open new bank.</title>
<headline>Capitol Bancorp files to open new bank.</headline>
<dateline>LANSING, Mich. 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capitol Bancorp Ltd said Thursday it filed an application with state banking regulators to open a new bank to serve the Grand Rapids, Michigan, area.</p>
<p>Capitol said it expects the new Kent Commerce Bank to open in the third quarter of 1997. A spokeswoman added that Capitol has yet to file applications for the new bank with federal banking regulators.</p>
<p>Capitol is a bank holding company with operations in eight communities in Michigan and Arizona.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
